# Unleash feature flags (scoped)

Load [`docs/agent/unleash-flags.md`](../../docs/agent/unleash-flags.md) for the full checklist.

## Rules

- New **feature** flags: enablement only — `cost-management.backend.<feature>`. ON = new path. Prefer `dev_fallback=True`.
- Do **not** name feature rollouts `disable-*` (ops kill-switches only).
- Constants/helpers in `koku/masu/processor/__init__.py`; `ONPREM_FLAG_DEFAULTS` only when needed.
- Unleash UI: strategy **stickiness = `schema`** (or `source_uuid` for source-scoped flags).
- CI is not `development`: mock the flag explicitly when asserting the new path.
- No markdown flag catalog — naming patterns + code are the source of truth.
